<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109662" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπώρ-εια</span></b>  (in some passages of <i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
		</span></i> (v. infr.) the best codd. give <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπώρεα</span></b> ,) ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the foot of a mountain, skirts of a mountain
				range,</i> mostly c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπωρείας ᾤκεον . . Ἴδης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					20.218
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκέουσι ὑπώρεαν ὀρέων ὑψηλῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.23
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1.110
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.158
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.199
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ὄρεα] συμμίσγοντα τὰς ὑπωρέας
				</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-είας</span> codd.)
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλήλοισι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				129
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τῆς ὑπωρέης
				</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-είης</span> codd.) 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ Κιθαιρῶνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					9.19
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				25
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-είης</span> codd.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ταῖς ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					681a
				</span></i>
			.</div>
